OL,3,GNEWSASea harvest service celebrates
OL,4,Afishing industry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fruits of the sea and the work of
OL,7,Fthe fishing industry are to be
OL,8,Fcelebrated in a cathedral service.
OL,10,FOrganisers of the National Harvest of
OL,11,Fthe Sea service at Exeter Cathedral say
OL,12,Fit is the first time fisherman and
OL,13,Fwomen have been commemorated in this
OL,14,Fway.
OL,16,FThe event on Sunday at 18:00 BST has
OL,17,Fbeen organised by groups including Love
OL,18,FBritish Food and Seafish, the UK's
OL,19,Fpublic body for the seafood industry.
OL,20,FFunds will be raised for The
OL,21,FFishermen's Mission, a charity which
OL,22,Fsupports the fishing community.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,344,340,200,160,0,100
